filenumber 632762
! THE EMPTY CELL in the enhancement search.
! Understressed (muinit 0.46, sigmainit 27.99 -> tau0 12.88 MPa vs Taiyi 15.0)
! + permeability enhancement ON + nonuniform initial perm (Taiyi map,
! 1.1e-12 near-well / 4e-13 far) + kL 1e-3 + LOW storage.
!
! Why this combination and no other: every enhancement run that matched the
! front (632509/632510/632522/632524, lambda/obs 0.97-0.99) has kL 1e-3 AND a
! far-field kpmin of 1e-15, which is 400x below Taiyi's 4e-13 and is what let
! wellhead pressure run to +280%. Every run with a realistic 4e-13 either used
! kL 1e-4/1e-5 (which suppressed slip entirely) or sat at phi*beta 1e-10 (too
! large for the front). This cell was never run.
!
! phi 0.005 x beta 2e-9 = phi*beta 1e-11;  kpmax 1.1e-12, kpmin 4e-13, kL 1e-3.
! kpmax is set at/just above the NEAR-WELL initial perm, the way the matching
! family set it, so slip propagates the existing conduit outward rather than
! building a super-conduit.
! Reference: 632721 is this deck with permev F (front 1.15x, pressure +11.2%).
! STORAGE AT THE PHYSICAL FLOOR, enhancement OFF.
! Storage is the only lever that raises lambda without suppressing initiation:
! phi*beta 3e-11 -> lambda 0.0236, 2e-11 -> 0.0492 at muinit 0.46.
! Enhancement is ruled out -- 632701/703/707/709/711 all produced NO slip even
! with a +5.8 MPa margin, because at kL 1e-5 it bleeds pf below dp_crit.
! phi 0.005 x beta 2e-9 = 5.0e-12. beta 2e-9 is already the stiff edge of
! defensible (water alone is 4.4e-10 /Pa); phi 0.005 halves the product again.
! sigmainit 27.99, muinit 0.46 -> tau0 12.88 MPa (Taiyi 15.0), dp_crit 6.53.
! If lambda still falls short here, the front cannot be matched in this
! configuration at ANY physically admissible storage.

problem 3dp
imax 601
jmax 601
ds 0.020

interval 30
nstep 400000
tmax 0.02191781
dtmax 43200
dtout 0.0002
parameterfromfile T
parameter_file "perm_taiyi_601_ds20.txt"
parameter_file_ncol 1
backslip T
vpl 0d0
a 0.015
b 0.012
dc 1e-4
f0 0.6
muinit 0.46
sigmainit 27.99
velinit 1d-12
limitsigma T
minsig 1
velmin 1d-20

pressurediffusion T
permev T

kp 4e-13
kpmin 4e-13
kpmax 1.1e-12
phi 0.005
beta 2e-9
eta 0.89e-3

kL 1e-3
kT 1e15

pfinit 0d0
bcl Dirichlet
bcr Dirichlet
bct Dirichlet
bcb Dirichlet
pbcl 0d0
pbcr 0d0
pbct 0d0
pbcb 0d0

injectionfromfile T

injection_file "june_clean.txt"


rigid 24
Sw_fwid 7.4e-9
rw 8.9e-2
